OL,3,CGianni Infantino says Fifa have
OL,4,Cscrapped World Cup investment plan
OL,6,FFifa "will not proceed" with plans to
OL,7,Fsell stakes in a company which would
OL,8,Frun the commercial and operational
OL,9,Faspects of its competitions, a
OL,10,Fstatement from president Gianni
OL,11,FInfantino said.
OL,13,FThe plan, which would include the
OL,14,Fmen's and women's World Cups, has been
OL,15,Frejected by three continental
OL,16,Fconfederations, with Uefa insisting
OL,17,Fits nations would boycott Fifa events.
OL,26,@nD@FOUnD@WO]
