OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1785707279
OL,3,CGianni Infantino says Fifa have
OL,4,Cscrapped World Cup investment plan
OL,6,FIn a statement released early on
OL,7,FSaturday, Infantino said: "The Fifa
OL,8,FForward Enterprise project was
OL,9,Fintended to provide a basis for
OL,10,Ffurther strengthening our Fifa Member
OL,11,FAssociations and our sport worldwide,
OL,12,Fespecially in those countries where
OL,13,Fsupport is most needed.
OL,15,F"And more so, as we said from the
OL,16,Foutset, to do this only if a majority
OL,17,Fof the Fifa Member Associations were
OL,18,Fin support and always subject to a
OL,19,Fconsultation process with them, the
OL,20,FFifa Council, the Confederations and
OL,21,Fwider stakeholders.
OL,26,@oD@[OUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1785707279
OL,3,CGianni Infantino says Fifa have
OL,4,Cscrapped World Cup investment plan
OL,6,F"Having listened carefully to all the
OL,7,Fviews, it has become clear that the
OL,8,Fproject has created divisions of a
OL,9,Fnature that, regardless of the level
OL,10,Fof support, are no longer in the
OL,11,Finterest of the objective set out in
OL,12,Fthe first place.
OL,14,F"Our purpose has always been, and will
OL,15,Falways be, to unite and improve.
OL,17,F"As a result, this proposal will not
OL,18,Fproceed.
OL,26,@nD@AOUvD@AOUyD@AOU
