OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1785707279
OL,3,CGianni Infantino says Fifa have
OL,4,Cscrapped World Cup investment plan
OL,6,F"Moving forward, my intent is to bring
OL,7,Fall interested parties back together
OL,8,Fin the coming days and weeks in the
OL,9,Fspirit of shared interest in our game,
OL,10,Fand with the objective to continue
OL,11,Fgrowing football everywhere,
OL,12,Fparticularly in those countries that
OL,13,Fmostly need our support."
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@YO]
