OL,3,CGianni Infantino says Fifa have
OL,4,Cscrapped World Cup investment plan
OL,6,FThe plans led to the resignation of
OL,7,FInfantino's senior adviser Carlos
OL,8,FCordeiro, while another senior Fifa
OL,9,Fofficial, chief operating officer
OL,10,FKevin Lamour, released a statement to
OL,11,Fthe Associated Press on Friday
OL,12,Fafternoon describing it as "a project
OL,13,Fof one person".
OL,15,FLamour did not resign the post he held
OL,16,Fsince 2024 but said he had a duty to
OL,17,Fhis colleagues.
OL,26,@tD@\OUuD@NO]
