OL,3,CGianni Infantino says Fifa have
OL,4,Cscrapped World Cup investment plan
OL,6,F"And if that means I lose my job, then
OL,7,Fso be it" the French official said. "I
OL,8,Fwill understand and respect that
OL,9,Fdecision. At least I'll sleep well
OL,10,Ftonight."
