OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1785707279
OL,3,CGianni Infantino says Fifa have
OL,4,Cscrapped World Cup investment plan
OL,6,F"The idea that it could even be
OL,7,Fbrought forward shows that, in my
OL,8,Fview, (Infantino) is the wrong man to
OL,9,Flead the organisation."
OL,11,FFifa's proposal involved the creation
OL,12,Fof Fifa Forward Enterprise (FFE) to
OL,13,Fmanage its competitions, with the most
OL,14,Fcontroversial aspect of the plan being
OL,15,Fthe intention to sell a 20 per cent
OL,16,Fstake to private investors.
