OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1785707279
OL,3,CGianni Infantino says Fifa have
OL,4,Cscrapped World Cup investment plan
OL,6,FThrive Eternal, a company founded by
OL,7,FJoshua Kushner, the brother of United
OL,8,FStates President Donald Trump's son-in-
OL,9,Flaw, Jared Kushner, has been earmarked
OL,10,Fas the lead investor. It has so far
OL,11,Fdeclined to comment on the matter.
OL,13,FThe president said on Friday he did
OL,14,Fnot speak to Infantino about the
OL,15,Fproposal.
