OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1785707279
OL,3,CGianni Infantino says Fifa have
OL,4,Cscrapped World Cup investment plan
OL,6,FAsian Football Confederation (AFC)
OL,7,Fpresident Shaikh Salman bin Ebrahim Al
OL,8,FKhalifa welcomed the proposal's
OL,9,Fwithdrawal and said any initiatives
OL,10,Fneed to follow "proper consultation,
OL,11,Fcollective dialogue and respect for
OL,12,Fthe established governance structures
OL,13,Fof our game".
OL,15,FHe said in a statement: "The AFC
OL,16,Fstands ready to support any initiative
OL,17,Fthat strengthens the unity of the
OL,18,Ffootball family, contributes to the
OL,19,Fcontinued growth of the game globally
OL,20,Fand delivers meaningful benefits to
OL,21,Fall stakeholders."
OL,26,@rD@POUuD@LO]wD@YOU}D@RO]
