OL,3,CGianni Infantino says Fifa have
OL,4,Cscrapped World Cup investment plan
OL,6,FAs well as Uefa's boycott and the
OL,7,Frejection from Concacaf, which
OL,8,Frepresents countries from North
OL,9,FAmerica, Central America and the
OL,10,FCaribbean, the AFC had called for an
OL,11,F"urgent review" of Fifa's governance
OL,12,Fand decision-making framework.
OL,14,FSouth American confederation Conmebol
OL,15,Fsaid it had "requested additional
OL,16,Finformation and clarification".
